      ],
      "text": "Persistent memory is stored locally in SQLite via Node's built-in node:sqlite at ~/.damocles/memory.v3.db, with no native modules or WASM, and memories carry kinds (fact, preference, episode, observation, note) and scopes (session, project, global)."
