        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4eae7c41a600e6262344a8dd9a98237e6a057e92e6d885d7593049752dde9e0a",
        "slc_7b301893769ce48827705434ce5b0e368c207f7f7e7086003c9c3054b9579298",
        "slc_d2d687e03e5c4c3f580d518fb0b01bf92ba3943338ac4eb7aa3a8cd449929e83",
        "slc_fe17ec6f62f753644da156f0a36b0fc2b83eb475a86fd28eac064a9b82e2b032"
      ],
      "text": "Hook safety is bounded by workspace trust: the global ~/.damocles/hooks.json is always honored while the project-level file is honored only in a trusted workspace, and both files hot-reload on change with global running before project."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a071ff44888d7b7771dc1187540e4751fb5a9d451b6a19c278f80dccf9960cda",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab",
          "git_sha": "2d6eb1e37f7fe3fa03688d8a168c911e3434d57c",
          "line_end": 479,
          "line_start": 479,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aizenvoltprime/damocles",
          "url": "https://github.com/AizenvoltPrime/damocles/blob/b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab/README.md#L479-L479"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b25241db89d4a5e807450eaf74ab6438c7b623f694ecff4c4bd9ba2c5ed2777f"
      ],
      "text": "Damocles runs on the pi agent engine and talks to Anthropic and OpenAI directly, keeping its own credentials under ~/.damocles/ isolated from the Claude Code CLI, whose settings and skills it reads but whose credentials it never touches."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_942c896eb8862499e4aad38d8e9a7b8749fc3ca92fa94d1ebe27ba0b38d37f76",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab",
          "git_sha": "2d6eb1e37f7fe3fa03688d8a168c911e3434d57c",
          "line_end": 475,
          "line_start": 471,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aizenvoltprime/damocles",
          "url": "https://github.com/AizenvoltPrime/damocles/blob/b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab/README.md#L471-L475"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b16f8e46842ebad1cc05029bfbc69a2b33c9cf366d70bd1224b6e5fc223ec59b"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements include VS Code 1.95.0+, a Claude or ChatGPT/Codex subscription or respective API keys, plus StepFun and DeepSeek provider keys; supported platforms are Windows, macOS, and Linux."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b87671e4d7b2e0c90c18f069f8789d34c4580f786628aa82a44708289831045a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab",
          "git_sha": "2d6eb1e37f7fe3fa03688d8a168c911e3434d57c",
          "line_end": 189,
          "line_start": 189,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "aizenvoltprime/damocles",
          "url": "https://github.com/AizenvoltPrime/damocles/blob/b8787a5e9b69694cd607326dcce721bbf1e04bab/README.md#L189-L189"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_811af96ae6924f53ef12f4b2704e6bbbce664d63a64ac7d444f2c48c23fd0a0c"
      ],
      "text": "Asset precedence is builtin > .damocles > .claude/.codex, with project overriding user within a scope and damocles.assetSourcePrecedence (default claude) breaking ties between compat sources; matching is case-insensitive."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a1bf26e521f7dd1353a5b3a9711685b790a7e9f20a9bc82ecb9a8f335d7d89f1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
